<title>HONG KONG: Sino Land confirms buying Chai Wan site.</title>
<headline>Sino Land confirms buying Chai Wan site.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sino Land Co Ltd chairman Robert Ng said on Tuesday the company and his family jointly purchased the Chai Wan site which sold at a Hong Kong government land auction for HK$11.82 billion.  </p>
<p>Ng told reporters the company/family consortium would spend HK$20 billion to develop the 25,592 square metre site on the eastern end of Hong Kong island.</p>
<p>&quot;Total investment in the development of the site will be HK$20 billion,&quot; Ng said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsrooom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
